ptions.')],binder_and_definition_audit=dict(E_finite_dimensional='Only the original physical Euclidean/Hilbert E is finite-dimensional. No finite-dimensional scalar or joint L2 assumption.',rank0='Subsingleton/rank0 E and L2 spaces are legal; norm/AE/extensionality/projection/positive-root uniqueness do not require Nontrivial.',positive_cap='0<α≤β and η>0, βη≤1 are retained; αη=1 is legal and no strict gap or full-space inverse is asserted.',probabilities='All μ/J/ν witnesses are conclusions derived from C2/Hessian/cap assumptions, installed proof locally.',complete_HP='HP=lpMeas with canonical complete closed-subspace instances, comap≤Product Fact derived from measurable_snd; no public completeness certificate.',operator_fields='REAL scalar and joint L2 throughout public theorem. Generic61/62 internal complex instances are dependencies, not binders.',canonical_M='Canonical compMeasurePreserving pullback; M0 equality proved using per-observable AE representatives.',same_witnesses='S from actual59 every-y law/Λdisintegration; U from actual59 reflected AE action, U2 equality proved; SAME T before/after conjugation.',domains='A:HP→HP, B:HP→joint, B.adjoint:joint→HP, ΓP:HP→HP; fulljoint Gram P-AJ² restricts to HP identity.',quantifiers='forall f norm/energy conjunct closed before separate forall G positive/square implication; no supplied alternativeenergy.',normalization='Tilted density normalization and integrability supplied by compiled actual parents, not a caller parameter.',public_extra_ingredients=[]),axiom_and_fakeclosure_audit=dict(public_axioms=axioms,scan=scan,scope='Comments removed for bounded token scan; compiled public axiom lists give transitive kernel evidence. Only owned modules and explicit current parents scanned; no whole repository claim.',production_Test_imports=False),negative_history=neg,v1_provenance=dict(snapshot=pairs[32]['original'],receipt='No explicitly qualified v1 compiler receipt supplied in this finite freeze. Source body preserved; no 